{"id":"e30651fa49cc3e16","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-diagonal-closure.md","title":"Diagonal Image","display":"df-diagonal-closure — Diagonal Image","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-diagonal-closure","aliases":["90-df-diagonal-closure"],"display":"df-diagonal-closure — Diagonal Image","depends_on":["[[90-df-diagonal-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-diagonal-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-diagonal-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-diagonal-closure — Diagonal Image"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9aaef8df4fb1222b\" href=\"?note=9aaef8df4fb1222b\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-function\">90-df-diagonal-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(D:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (diagonal function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9aaef8df4fb1222b\" href=\"?note=9aaef8df4fb1222b\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-function\">90-df-diagonal-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diag}\">\\(\\mathrm{Diag}\\)</span> (diagonal-image operator, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}closure}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Diag}(S)\\coloneqq D[S]=\\{D(x):x\\in S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}closure}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Diag}(S)\\coloneqq D[S]=\\{D(x):x\\in S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diag}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Diag}(S)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 下的对角像；保留文件标签中的历史名称 <code>diagonal-closure</code></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(x) = \\mathrm{Sub}_S(x, x)\">\\(D(x) = \\mathrm{Sub}_S(x, x)\\)</span>：对角函数 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9aaef8df4fb1222b\" href=\"?note=9aaef8df4fb1222b\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-function\">90-df-diagonal-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\)</span>：相对于固定语法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的替换函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"9aaef8df4fb1222b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"9aaef8df4fb1222b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ (diagonal function, see [[90-df-diagonal-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"9aaef8df4fb1222b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$D(x) = \\mathrm{Sub}_S(x, x)$：对角函数 (see [[90-df-diagonal-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diag}","display